      "english": "Entering the Wrong Bathroom"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "星期天，保罗和小乐去逛商场。",
      "traditional": "星期天，保羅和小樂去逛商場。",
      "pinyin": "xīng qī tiān bǎo luó hé xiǎo lè qù guàng shāng chǎng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "保罗要上厕所，就去了商场的洗手间，",
      "traditional": "保羅要上廁所，就去了商場的洗手間，",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó yào shàng cè suǒ jiù qù le shāng chǎng de xǐ shǒu jiān",
      "english": "This Sunday, Paul and Xiao Le went to a shopping mall."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小乐站在门口等他。",
      "traditional": "小樂站在門口等他。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè zhàn zài mén kǒu děng tā",
      "english": "Paul needed to go to the toilet, so he went to a bathroom at the mall."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "可是，保罗刚进去几秒钟就跑出来了，说：",
      "traditional": "可是，保羅剛進去幾秒鐘就跑出來了，說：",
      "pinyin": "kě shì bǎo luó gāng jìn qù jǐ miǎo zhōng jiù pǎo chū lái le shuō",
      "english": "Xiao Le was standing outside waiting for him."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "“太尴尬了！我进错厕所了，里面有个阿姨！”",
      "traditional": "“太尷尬了！我進錯廁所了，裡面有個阿姨！”",
      "pinyin": "tài gān gà le wǒ jìn cuò cè suǒ le lǐ miàn yǒu ge ā yí",
      "english": "However, only a few second after Paul went into the bathroom, he ran back out and said:"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "说完他跑到另一边的洗手间，",
      "traditional": "說完他跑到另一邊的洗手間，",
      "pinyin": "shuō wán tā pǎo dào lìng yì biān de xǐ shǒu jiān",
      "english": "“So embarrassing! I went into the wrong bathroom and there was an old lady inside!”"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "可是刚打开门，里面走出来一个小姑娘，很惊讶地看了保罗一眼。",
      "traditional": "可是剛打開門，裡面走出來一個小姑娘，很驚訝地看了保羅一眼。",
      "pinyin": "kě shì gāng dǎ kāi mén lǐ miàn zǒu chū lái yí ge xiǎo gū niang hěn jīng yà de kàn le bǎo luó yì yǎn",
      "english": "He then ran to the bathroom on the other side."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "保罗觉得很奇怪：“怎么两边都是女厕所，男厕所在哪儿？”",
      "traditional": "保羅覺得很奇怪：“怎麼兩邊都是女廁所，男廁所在哪兒？”",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó jué de hěn qí guài zěn me liǎng biān dōu shì nǚ cè suǒ nán cè suǒ zài nǎ'r",
      "english": "However, when he opened the door, a girl walked out and gave Paul a surprised look."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "这时，第一个洗手间里的阿姨走出来了，手里拿着一个大垃圾袋。",
      "traditional": "這時，第一個洗手間裡的阿姨走出來了，手裡拿著一個大垃圾袋。",
      "pinyin": "zhè shí dì yī ge xǐ shǒu jiān lǐ de ā yí zǒu chū lái le shǒu lǐ ná zhe yí ge dà lā jī dài",
      "english": "Paul was confused: “Why are both sides female bathrooms? Where is the male bathroom?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "小乐说：“她是商场的保洁阿姨，刚才在打扫男厕所。",
      "traditional": "小樂說：“她是商場的保潔阿姨，剛才在打掃男廁所。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè shuō tā shì shāng chǎng de bǎo jié ā yí gāng cái zài dǎ sǎo nán cè suǒ",
      "english": "At this moment, the old lady walked out from the first bathroom with a big trash bag in her hands."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "现在你可以去了，别再进错了！”",
      "traditional": "現在你可以去了，別再進錯了！”",
      "pinyin": "xiàn zài nǐ kě yǐ qù le bié zài jìn cuò le",
      "english": "Xiao Le said: “She is a cleaning lady at the mall, and was cleaning the male bathroom just now.”"
    }
  ],
