    "sentence_translations": [
      "Entering the Wrong Bathroom",
      "",
      "This Sunday, Paul and Xiao Le went to a shopping mall.",
      "Paul needed to go to the toilet, so he went to a bathroom at the mall.",
      "Xiao Le was standing outside waiting for him.",
      "However, only a few second after Paul went into the bathroom, he ran back out and said:",
      "“So embarrassing! I went into the wrong bathroom and there was an old lady inside!”",
      "He then ran to the bathroom on the other side.",
      "However, when he opened the door, a girl walked out and gave Paul a surprised look.",
      "Paul was confused: “Why are both sides female bathrooms? Where is the male bathroom?”",
      "At this moment, the old lady walked out from the first bathroom with a big trash bag in her hands.",
      "Xiao Le said: “She is a cleaning lady at the mall, and was cleaning the male bathroom just now.”",
      "“Now you can use the toilet. Don’t go to the wrong one this time!”"
    ]
  }
